t pack</p><div class="buy_row"><div class="button_message"><a class="button buy_btn" href="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/sci-fi-lab-medical-props/purchase">Download Now</a><span class="buy_message"><span class="sub">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class="columns"><div class="left_col column"><div class="formatted_description user_formatted"><p>This is a low-poly prop set built around one job: dressing a sci-fi lab so it reads as a working facility, not a set of props scattered on a floor. It covers the full workflow, from storage and analysis to containment and cleanup, so you can build a believable room instead of hunting for the one missing piece. Free lab packs on itch tend to top out around 20-25 models and require attribution; this one ships 31 CC0 props with no credit line needed, so you can drop it into a commercial build and never think about it again.</p>
<p>It's aimed at solo devs and small teams building extraction horror, facility roguelikes, or immersive sims, where a lab needs to look lived-in from multiple angles, not just dressed for one hero shot. Every prop shares a single 1024x1024 texture atlas, so a whole room draws in one batch, and base-centred pivots mean scattering, stacking, and rotating props in-engine takes no extra setup.</p>
<h3>What's inside</h3>
<p>Containment &amp; storage: specimen canister (hero), specimen jar, cryo pod (2.1m), cryo rack, gas cylinder, chemical vat, drum, storage cabinet, shelf unit. Bench &amp; analysis: lab bench, flask + beaker, test tube rack, dropper bottles, funnel stand, mortar &amp; pestle, balance scale, alembic, centrifuge, autoclave, petri stack, vitals console, analysis console. Field &amp; safety: syringe, first aid kit, fire extinguisher, biohazard bin, hazard sign. Fixtures: bunsen burner, hot plate, lab stool, ceiling lamp.</p>
<p>31 props, 14,734 tris total.</p>
<h3>The colourways</h3>
<p>$7.95 unlocks three full palette rebuilds of every prop:</p>
<ul><li><strong>Contamination</strong>: hazard-yellow and biohazard black, outbreak in progress</li><li><strong>Derelict</strong>: rust, grime, and dead power, the facility nobody came back for</li><li><strong>Apothecary</strong>: brass, verdigris, and oak, the whole pack reads as fantasy alchemy instead of sci-fi</li></ul>
<p>Free base palette: <strong>Clean Room</strong>, pristine white and steel.</p>
<h3>Tech specs</h3>
<ul><li>Tri range: 176 to 1,240 tris per prop; 14,734 total across 31 props</li><li>Formats: GLB + FBX</li><li>Texture: one 1024x1024 gradient atlas per pack</li><li>Scale: real-world metres, base-centred pivots</li><li>Geometry: deterministic procedural. Every prop is emitted by a Python program, so each build is byte-identical and the whole pack shares one coherent spec.</li><li>Free tier: Clean Room palette, CC0 1.0 (public domain, commercial use, no attribution)</li><li>Paid tier: Contamination, Derelict, Apothecary palettes, $7.95, royalty-free license, no redistribution as standalone assets</li></ul></div><div class="more_information_toggle open"><div class="toggle_row"><a class="toggle_info_btn">More information<svg width="12" height="6" version="1.1" aria-hidden="" viewBox="0 0 37 20" class="svgicon icon_down_tick" role="img"><path d="m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z"></path></svg></a></div><div class="info_panel_wrapper" style="display: block;"><div class="game_info_panel_widget base_widget" id="game_info_panel_265520"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title="16 August 2026 @ 20:29 UTC"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-stopwatch"></span> 41 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href="https://itch.io/game-assets/released">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Category</td><td><a href="https://itch.io/game-assets">Assets</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href="https://thesidequestshop.itch.io/">The SideQuest Shop</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td><td><a href="https://itch.io/game-assets/tag-3d">3D</a>, <a href="https://itch.io/game-assets/tag-cc0">cc0</a>, <a href="https://itch.io/game-assets/tag-horror">Horror</a>, <a href="https://itch.io/game-assets/tag-laboratory">labora